WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568 size:84% position:42%
Now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite --

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:04.270 size:84% position:42%
"My Weird Superstition"
stories from you guys.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:08.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here we go. This first one's
from @JesseBetts11.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says,
"Whenever I'm home alone,

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:10.877 line:92%
I always say, 'I see you'

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:14.180
before falling asleep just
to see if anyone responds."

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.816 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Okay, okay.
Then I'll leave then.

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can see me?
I thought I was hiding but --"

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-"All right."

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:27.093 line:92%
This one's from @hasasimo.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.496
He says, "My brother-in-law
doesn't allow his mother

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.464
into the room if
the Dallas Cowboys are winning.

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:34.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
If she's already in the room,
he doesn't let her leave.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's done this
for over 20 years.

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:39.739
The cowboys haven't been to
a Super Bowl in over 20 years."

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:42.075 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:45.211 line:92%
Hey, leave your mom alone!

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's his fault.
-Yeah.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.850 line:92%
This one's from @NicolaFry1980.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says,
"When I take painkillers,

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have to whisper
what's wrong with me first

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:56.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
like 'headache'
or 'sore shoulder,'

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:58.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
or else the medicine
won't know where to go."

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:00.860 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.695 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"Sore shoulder."

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:06.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
Mnh.
-I like that one.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:09.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This one's from
@RunningUnicorns.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:11.638 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ohh.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:12.305 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
How quaint.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She says,
"I never eat the first Pringle

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:17.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
in a can, that's
the barrier Pringle.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.312 line:92%
I throw it away every time."

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.214 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:23.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
What? Oh, yeah.
-Yeah, no.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:25.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"No, no, no,
that's the barrier Pringle.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:26.786 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Unh-unh. Nice try!"

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.455
-That's got factory germs on it.
-"Nice try.

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:30.890 size:78% position:39%
I don't want anything
to do with that one."

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.292 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.961 line:92%
This one's from @timeofbacon.

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:35.695 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:36.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Time of bacon.
-Yeah.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:41.101
He says, "Any time someone on
TV winks, I have to wink back."

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:43.703 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:46.106 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience cheering ]

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.941 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"I see you!"

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:52.512 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Who?!"

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:55.181 line:92%
-This one's from @motownphyllie.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says -- This is great.
-What'd she say?

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.985
-"When I was little, my mom
told me that every grain

00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:00.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
of rice I didn't finish
in my dinner bowl

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:03.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
would be a zit
on my future husband's face."

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.025 line:92%
[ Audience "ohhs", laughter ]

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.794 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:10.964 size:84% position:42% line:92%
What?! Oh, my goodness.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:13.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wow.
-Oh.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:17.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This one's from
@DarolineCavrnas.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:18.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says, "I had a bad case
of the hiccups,

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:21.741
and they finally went away when
I talked about Sandra Bullock.

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:24.210
Now my brother and I will
discuss Sandra Bullock

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.313
when one of us have hiccups
and they always go away."

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:28.515 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:31.184 line:92%
Really? That's the secret?

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:34.354
Stare at a spoon and just think
of Sandra Bullock.

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:36.656 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Yeah, Bandra Sullock.

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.324 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:40.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Hiccups ]
You just gave my hiccups.

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:41.361 line:92%
-Yeah, I gave you the hiccups.

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:41.895 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:44.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This last one's
from @rtran1251.

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:46.533 line:92%
You think that's a robot?

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:47.600 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I hope so.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.103 size:78% position:39%
-She says, "I halfway
believe in aliens,

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:52.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I try my hardest not
to think about them

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:54.641 size:88% position:44%
because if they're real,
they for sure read minds

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:57.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then they'd know
that I know that they know."

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:58.044 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh. Okay.

00:02:58.044 --> 00:02:58.878 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

